      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-spacex-merger-52-percent.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/nasdaq-marketsite-times-square.jpg",
      "title": "\"52% dilution\" in a SpaceX-Tesla deal doesn't mean 52% more shares. I ran the math from both companies' filings",
      "summary": "Tesla and SpaceX shares fell again on Wednesday as investors weighed a possible all-stock merger. Gary Black's widely quoted \"52% dilution\" figure checks out, but several outlets described it as SpaceX issuing 52% more shares. Using the share counts in both 10-Qs, the issuance would be more than double that.",
      "tag": "Business",
      "date": "2026-11-25T17:14:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/nasdaq-marketsite-times-square-480w.webp"
    },
    {
      "url": "/dispatch/eu-tad-postponed-december-15.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-nav-screen-hero.jpg",
      "title": "The EU has postponed its Tesla Assisted Driving meeting to December 15. A rejection would invalidate national approvals already granted",
      "summary": "A European Commission spokesperson told Reuters on 25 Nov 2026 that the EU meeting expected to consider bloc-wide approval of Tesla Assisted Driving has been postponed until December 15. A rejection at EU level would invalidate the national approvals already granted. No reason was given.",
      "tag": "FSD in Europe",
      "date": "2026-11-25T17:06:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-nav-screen-hero-480w.webp"
    },
    {
      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-robotaxi-6-million-miles.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-cybercab-zurich-blume-2026.jpg",
      "title": "Tesla's official Robotaxi page now shows more than 6 million autonomous miles. The last dated safety results still stop at 3.1 million on 18 Oct",
      "summary": "On 24 Nov, Tesla's live Robotaxi counter stood at more than 6.01 million autonomous miles. The official safety results still cover 22 Jan to 18 Oct, when the fleet had driven 3.1 million miles.",
      "tag": "Robotaxi",
      "date": "2026-11-24T17:16:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-cybercab-zurich-blume-2026-480w.webp"
