    {
      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-fsd-v15-first-wave.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-nav-screen-hero.jpg",
      "title": "FSD v15 is in owners' cars. The release notes, who has it, and what \"25x\" actually measures",
      "summary": "Tesla started rolling out FSD (Supervised) v15.0.1 on Saturday, hours after Musk said wide release was next month. So far it's reaching HW4 Model Ys in the US. I went through the release notes and Tesla's three different ways of describing its 25x claim.",
      "tag": "FSD",
      "date": "2026-11-24T17:14:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/tesla-nav-screen-hero-480w.webp"
    },
    {
      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-ai5-optimus-cars-stay-ai4.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/optimus-stockholm-ulkl.jpg",
      "title": "Musk: AI5 goes to Optimus and cars stay on AI4. AI4.5 loses 8GB of planned RAM because memory got expensive",
      "summary": "Over one Sunday of replies on X, Elon Musk said Tesla's AI5 chip is going to Optimus, cars will remain on AI4, AI4 now costs twice as much because of memory prices, and the planned AI4.5 board was cut from 32GB to 24GB of RAM. Here's how that fits what Tesla said on its last two earnings calls.",
      "tag": "AI hardware",
      "date": "2026-11-24T17:12:00Z",
      "thumb": "/assets/dispatch/optimus-stockholm-ulkl-480w.webp"
    },
    {
      "url": "/dispatch/tesla-polysilicon-robstown-3-1b.html",
      "image": "/assets/dispatch/polysilicon-rod-roonguthai.jpg",
      "title": "Tesla wants a Texas tax break for a $3.1 billion polysilicon plant near Corpus Christi. Here's what its application says",
      "summary": "Tesla has applied under Texas's JETI program for a school-tax limit on a proposed $3.1 billion polysilicon refinery near Robstown in Nueces County. The filing promises 515 jobs by 2032 and says Tesla may build elsewhere without the incentive. I went through the numbers.",
      "tag": "Tesla / Energy",
      "date": "2026-11-24T17:10:00Z",
